  258: /// Derives a document outline from heading blocks.
  259: ///
  260: /// The controller listens to a [WenzRichTextController] and emits immutable
  261: /// [OutlineItem] snapshots. Calling [select], [selectByBlockId], or
  262: /// [selectByAnchor] moves the host selection to the heading start; a mounted
  263: /// [WenzRichTextEditor] will then scroll the caret into view via its existing
  264: /// selection handling.
  265: ///
  266: /// Heading collapse interaction contract:
  267: /// * A collapse handle is eligible only for a non-empty top-level
  268: ///   [TextBlockNode] whose [TextBlockNode.type] is [BlockType.heading].
  269: /// * The covered range starts after that heading and stops before the next
  270: ///   heading whose normalized level is less than or equal to the current level;
  271: ///   lower-level headings and ordinary blocks stay inside the range.
  272: /// * Empty headings or headings without covered child blocks should be treated
  273: ///   as non-collapsible or disabled.
  274: /// * Toggling collapse is editor view state. It must not mutate document
  275: ///   content or enter undo/redo history, and read-only editors may still toggle
  276: ///   this view state.
  277: ///
  278: /// Fold state is keyed by heading block id and remains independent from the
  279: /// document model/history. Visible-block projection is layered on top of this
  280: /// model by the widget layer.
